      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DREAMER (8) has been hard to follow lately, running fifth (19.12) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Looks suited here and big improvement expected. SPRING NICK (3) hit the ground running and was prominent throughout but faded out of it when 6th at this track in a Mix 5. Form here at the trip sound including seven wins. Leading chance. EVEN MORE (6) was below best at his last couple, the latest finishing seventh at this track, but was among the placings at this track three back. Well placed here and can atone this time. HEADING NORTH (2) continues to race well and is sure to be competitive again.",
